{"verse_key": "10:101", "surah": 10, "verse": 101, "text_uthmani": "قُلِ ٱنظُرُوا۟ مَاذَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَمَا تُغْنِى ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتُ وَٱلنُّذُرُ عَن قَوْمٍ لَّا يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "Say, \"Observe what is in the heavens and the earth.\" But of no avail will be signs or warners to a people who do not believe.", "verse_from_ms": 2168120, "verse_to_ms": 2183530, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قُلِ", "start_ms": 2168120, "end_ms": 2168810}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱنظُرُوا۟", "start_ms": 2168810, "end_ms": 2170100}, {"i": 2, "text": "مَاذَا", "start_ms": 2170100, "end_ms": 2170790}, {"i": 3, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 2170790, "end_ms": 2171030}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ", "start_ms": 2171030, "end_ms": 2172460}, {"i": 5, "text": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "start_ms": 2172460, "end_ms": 2174240}, {"i": 6, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 2174240, "end_ms": 2174940}, {"i": 7, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 2174940, "end_ms": 2175560}, {"i": 8, "text": "تُغْنِى", "start_ms": 2175560, "end_ms": 2176740}, {"i": 9, "text": "ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتُ", "start_ms": 2176740, "end_ms": 2178110}, {"i": 10, "text": "وَٱلنُّذُرُ", "start_ms": 2178110, "end_ms": 2179000}, {"i": 11, "text": "عَن", "start_ms": 2179000, "end_ms": 2179750}, {"i": 12, "text": "قَوْمٍ", "start_ms": 2179750, "end_ms": 2180070}, {"i": 13, "text": "لَّا", "start_ms": 2180070, "end_ms": 2182815}, {"i": 14, "text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}